   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Consider Erikson’s concept of integrity versus despair. Reflect on an older adult in your life who you believe has reached a sense of integrity or is struggling with despair. What life experiences do you think contributed to their current outlook? How does Erikson’s theory help you understand their emotional state?",
